; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) — SVCB/HTTPS records
; Draft: draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid | RFC 9460 (SVCB/HTTPS)
;
; HOW TO APPLY
; 1) These records CANNOT be published for *.vercel.app subdomains
;    (DNS for vercel.app is controlled by Vercel). To pass the DNS-AID
;    check you MUST use a custom domain (e.g. mohamedtarek.dev) with
;    Vercel + a DNS provider that supports SVCB/HTTPS (Cloudflare, etc.).
; 2) At your authoritative DNS provider, add the records below,
;    replacing the example host with your custom domain.
; 3) Enable DNSSEC at your registrar / DNS provider (required: validating
;    resolvers must return authenticated data). On Cloudflare: Dashboard
;    -> DNS -> DNSSEC -> Enable. On Vercel custom domains: follow
;    Vercel Docs "Enabling DNSSEC" and add the DS record at your registrar.
; 4) Verify via DoH (same resolvers the scanner uses):
;    https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query?name=_index._agents.YOUR-DOMAIN&type=HTTPS
;    https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query?name=_a2a._agents.YOUR-DOMAIN&type=SVCB
;    curl -H 'accept: application/dns-json' \
;      'https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query?name=_index._agents.YOUR-DOMAIN&type=HTTPS'
;
; NOTES
; - ServiceMode (priority 1) with target = your HTTPS host.
; - alpn + port are standard RFC 9460 keys; experimental DNS-AID keys
;   MUST use numeric keyNNNNN form until registered (private-use range
;   65280-65534). Here key65280 carries the agent endpoint path and
;   key65281 carries the protocol label.
; - TTL 3600 is a sane default; adjust as needed.

; --- Replace DOMAIN below with your custom domain when you have one ---
; Agent index / discovery endpoint
_index._agents.mohamed-tarek-abdelhady.vercel.app. 3600 IN HTTPS 1 mohamed-tarek-abdelhady.vercel.app. alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="index"

; A2A protocol endpoint
_a2a._agents.mohamed-tarek-abdelhady.vercel.app. 3600 IN SVCB 1 mohamed-tarek-abdelhady.vercel.app. alpn="a2a" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="a2a"

; MCP protocol endpoint
_mcp._agents.mohamed-tarek-abdelhady.vercel.app. 3600 IN SVCB 1 mohamed-tarek-abdelhady.vercel.app. alpn="mcp" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json" key65281="mcp"

; --- Generic BIND-style template for a custom domain (copy/paste) ---
; _index._agents.@ 3600 IN HTTPS 1 @ alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="index"
; _a2a._agents.@ 3600 IN SVCB 1 @ alpn="a2a" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="a2a"
; _mcp._agents.@ 3600 IN SVCB 1 @ alpn="mcp" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json" key65281="mcp"

; --- Cloudflare Dashboard equivalent (Type HTTPS/SVCB, Name, Priority, Target, Params) ---
; Type: HTTPS | Name: _index._agents | Priority: 1 | Target: @ | Params: alpn="h2" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="index"
; Type: SVCB  | Name: _a2a._agents   | Priority: 1 | Target: @ | Params: alpn="a2a" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/agent-card.json" key65281="a2a"
; Type: SVCB  | Name: _mcp._agents   | Priority: 1 | Target: @ | Params: alpn="mcp" port=443 mandatory=alpn,port key65280="/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json" key65281="mcp"
